      "body": "**Santa Aurelia High School's athletic identity is the Captains**, reflecting the city's longstanding maritime culture. Proposed colors are burgundy, antique gold and cream. Its working student section is the **Quarterdeck**, field **Harbor Field** and marching band **Harbor Brass**. Athletics, clubs, music and community support play a major part in city life.\n\nThe Captains face the [[wisps|Willowwick Wisps]] in the proposed **Lantern and Anchor Game** and the [[southbank-wolves|Southbank Wolves]] in the **Harbor–Howl**. These fixture names and sports specialties are working lore; see [[valley-highschool-rivalries|Valley High School Rivalries]].\n\n**Football dynasty:** the Captains have six fictional Oregon state championship seasons: **1979, 1991, 2003, 2012, 2019, and 2024**. They are a feared statewide program, not merely a local rival. The [[wisps|Wisps]] and [[southbank-wolves|Wolves]] also have multiple titles. See [[valley-highschool-rivalries|the Valley Three]].",
